# Virtual Try-On & Closet API

An AI-powered backend API built with FastAPI for user authentication, wishlist management, virtual try-on, and closet outfit suggestions.

---

## Features

### Login / Authentication
- User registration and login endpoints.
- Secure authentication management (JWT or session-based).
- User data stored in `users` table.

### Wishlist
- Add, view, and manage wishlist items.
- Each wishlist item stores product info like name, description, price, image URL.
- Items linked to users by `username`.
- Data stored in `wishlist` table.

### Virtual Try-On
- Upload face, body, and dress images.
- Performs face swapping using MediaPipe.
- Background removal and garment overlay with Rembg and Pillow.
- Returns a composited try-on image.

### Virtual Closet & Outfit Suggestion
- Upload closet items with image and AI-simulated metadata (category and color).
- Closet items linked to users.
- Suggests outfit combinations based on color compatibility.
- Uses `closet_items` table for items storage.

---

